{"title":"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/f/33f56b9f314ef46cd5a96416609aae30fd9af0de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{36 + 64} - \\sqrt{25 - 16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"172\" height=\"21\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce509b4bf9e7e261fcde7ee19fd4b0f2d5f9ea35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 5 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 7 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 13 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 11 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"406\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/2/df24d4f9df84a4c2259b36e9185369784a2cc958.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{36 + 64} - \\sqrt{25 - 16} = \\sqrt{100} - \\sqrt{9} = 10 - 3 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"438\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/1/c41d3a5a4f9253ba5aa9f6fb9fbb04c926f200b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^2=36, 8^2 = 64, 5^2 = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"195\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/8/128f11525fcf9981d3135935c9ea1784056b60ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^2 = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> form a Pythagorean triple, as well as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so we can see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/d/ced68b137b8212606881bb7cd69aaac39d45545f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{36 + 64} - \\sqrt{25 - 16} = 10 - 3 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"325\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal\">2006 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC